stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending
    Pending: Domain record created
    Pending --> Verifying: Operator requests verification
    Verifying --> Pending: DNS/TLS proof incomplete
    Verifying --> Active: Verification succeeds
    Active: Resolver may map host to organization
    Active --> Primary: Operator selects primary domain
    Primary: One active primary domain
    Primary --> Active: Another domain becomes primary
    Active --> Disabled: Operator disables domain
    Disabled --> Verifying: Operator re-verifies
    Active --> Suspended: Organization suspended
    Primary --> Suspended: Organization suspended
    Suspended --> Active: Organization reactivated
    Active --> [*]: Organization closure finalizes
    Primary --> [*]: Organization closure finalizes

    note right of Active
        Request routing must fail closed when
        the host is unknown, unverified, disabled,
        or no longer attached to an active organization.
    end note